00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:09.560
Four local GPS wrote to Health Minister Blair Boyer and called the model unsafe and unsustainable.

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:15.020
Their core claim is clinical. A doctor cannot cover maternity and emergency on call at once,

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:19.680
